00:38:09.900 --> 00:38:12.120
I don't like to use in the military

00:38:12.120 --> 00:38:13.863
or some kind of confrontation.

00:38:15.060 --> 00:38:16.430
In the medical...

00:38:19.110 --> 00:38:24.110
In the medical field, I want
to make a joke of my wife.

00:38:24.450 --> 00:38:29.450
She only trust the guy
with experience, right?

00:38:30.030 --> 00:38:31.440
So when you see a doctor,

00:38:31.440 --> 00:38:34.320
you want to see a experienced doctor.

00:38:34.320 --> 00:38:35.153
Am I right?

00:38:36.180 --> 00:38:37.320
Okay.

00:38:37.320 --> 00:38:39.033
But look at it.

00:38:40.404 --> 00:38:45.404
To give you some idea, if a
doctor is 50 or 60 years old,

00:38:47.070 --> 00:38:51.033
