00:39:04.318 --> 00:39:05.820
(audience laughing)

00:39:05.820 --> 00:39:07.980
Okay, now here comes a question.

00:39:07.980 --> 00:39:09.850
If you want to do the operation

00:39:11.730 --> 00:39:16.380
