00:42:07.021 --> 00:42:07.854
(Jeff chuckles)

00:42:07.854 --> 00:42:10.650
And the AI will tell me, it say, "Mr. Wei,

00:42:10.650 --> 00:42:15.570
you are overweight for five kilogram.

00:42:15.570 --> 00:42:18.840
You better to do the following."

00:42:18.840 --> 00:42:21.300
And whether I follow it or not,

00:42:21.300 --> 00:42:24.390
then I have to wear a smart watch.

00:42:24.390 --> 00:42:27.330
And then the watch will
measure my heartbeat,

00:42:27.330 --> 00:42:32.330
measure my temperature,
send it to a computer,

00:42:33.420 --> 00:42:35.160
and computer give me a warning,

00:42:35.160 --> 00:42:38.700
say that, "You are not listen to me,

00:42:38.700 --> 00:42:41.190
so you have better watch out.

00:42:41.190 --> 00:42:43.925
You only have how many years to live."

00:42:43.925 --> 00:42:44.910
(audience laughing)

00:42:44.910 --> 00:42:46.680
Then I will get nervous, right?

00:42:46.680 --> 00:42:50.010
So I start to follow the instruction.

00:42:50.010 --> 00:42:53.130
But anyway, in the future,

00:42:53.130 --> 00:42:57.513
semiconductor will be the key in our life,

00:42:58.350 --> 00:42:59.523
something like that.

00:43:01.770 --> 00:43:03.120
Yeah, another one.
- Okay, maybe we have time

00:43:03.120 --> 00:43:05.310
for one last question.

00:43:05.310 --> 00:43:06.855
Yeah?

00:43:06.855 --> 00:43:07.797
